BT 1 0 0 1 30 1320 Tm 3 Tr /F1 9 Tf 10.8 TL (Gate II of VI Grade How much can this thing hurt us? grade  \267  verb  \267  to place an agent on the risk ladder by how much damage its worst day can do.) Tj T* (Place the agent on the ladder before designing anything. The tier decides the evidence you will need, the audit trail you will keep, and what you) Tj T* (build first. Tier 4 is where real money, real promises and case law live. Ask Air Canada how the chatbot tier went. Figure 2. The four-tier risk) Tj T* (ladder. The climb is earned, never assumed. Failure smells like Starting at Tier 4 because that is where the ROI slide points. ) Tj /F2 9 Tf 10.8 TL (\247) Tj /F1 9 Tf 10.8 TL ( Start low. Earn the) Tj T* (climb. Bhargava P The Six Gates \267 5 / 14) Tj T* ET
 
