BT 1 0 0 1 30 1320 Tm 3 Tr /F1 9 Tf 10.8 TL (Gate III of VI Limit Who is allowed to write what? limit  \267  verb  \267  to fix, argument by argument, what the agent may write, and enforce it outside) Tj T* (the prompt. A tool call is a form with blanks. For every blank, name who holds the pen: the application \(IDs, amounts, recipients, injected by code\),) Tj T* (the model \(free text, its actual job\), or a human \(money, waivers, precedent\). Then enforce it at the tool boundary, deterministically. To pass: show) Tj T* (the tool catalog with every argument labeled. Figure 3. Three pens for one tool call. Prompts request; boundaries enforce. Failure smells like A) Tj T* (consequential argument that is model-writable because \223the prompt says to be careful.\224 ) Tj /F2 9 Tf 10.8 TL (\247) Tj /F1 9 Tf 10.8 TL ( Least privilege was never just about tools. It is about) Tj T* (arguments. Bhargava P The Six Gates \267 6 / 14) Tj T* ET
 
