BT 1 0 0 1 30 1320 Tm 3 Tr /F1 9 Tf 10.8 TL (The Paper Trail What each gate leaves behind A gate that leaves no artifact was not passed. It was waved. Auditors, new team members, and your own) Tj T* (future self should be able to reconstruct every decision from six small documents. None of them is longer than a page. I Justify The completed) Tj T* (sentence: \223this must be an agent because\205\224 signed by product owner + architect II Grade A grade memo with the worst-case failure written down signed) Tj T* (by the risk owner III Limit The tool catalog with every argument\222s pen labeled signed by security IV Build The architecture sketch and the escalation) Tj T* (log location signed by engineering V Prove The frozen eval, its results, and how to reproduce them signed by the eval owner VI Run The ledger, and a) Tj T* (named 2am owner signed by operations ) Tj /F2 9 Tf 10.8 TL (\247) Tj /F1 9 Tf 10.8 TL ( Evidence is the only deliverable that survives a reorg. Bhargava P The Six Gates \267 11 / 14) Tj T* ET
 
