BT 1 0 0 1 30 1320 Tm 3 Tr /F1 9 Tf 10.8 TL (The Usual Objections Yes, but Three pushbacks arrive in every review. Here are the answers. \223This will slow us down.\224 Gates cost hours. Incidents cost) Tj T* (quarters. Gate I is one sentence, and it is the sentence that cancels the six-month project that should never have started. \223We\222re just doing a) Tj T* (pilot.\224 Pilots become production by demo momentum, never by decision. Grade it anyway. A pilot is simply an agent standing at Gate V without evidence) Tj T* (yet. \223Our vendor handles safety.\224 Your vendor bounds the model. Nobody but you can bound your arguments, your tools, and your tiers. Gates II, III,) Tj T* (and VI are yours alone, and they are the ones that make the news. ) Tj /F2 9 Tf 10.8 TL (\247) Tj /F1 9 Tf 10.8 TL ( Gates are not bureaucracy. Bureaucracy is what grows where method is missing.) Tj T* (Bhargava P The Six Gates \267 12 / 14) Tj T* ET
 
