BT 1 0 0 1 30 1320 Tm 3 Tr /F1 9 Tf 10.8 TL (Notes & Further Reading The Air Canada case Moffatt v. Air Canada, British Columbia Civil Resolution Tribunal, February 2024. The tribunal rejected) Tj T* (the airline\222s argument that its chatbot was \223a separate legal entity responsible for its own actions.\224 On building agents Anthropic, \223Building) Tj T* (Effective Agents\224 \(2024\): the case for simple, composable patterns over frameworks. OpenAI, \223A Practical Guide to Building Agents\224 \(2025\). On risk and) Tj T* (governance NIST AI Risk Management Framework 1.0 \(2023\) and ISO/IEC 42001:2023. The gates are a team-level, one-hour walk through the same terrain) Tj T* (those frameworks cover at organization level. Prior work The Rubric Test \(Gate I\), the four-tier ladder \(Gate II\), and the three-pens model of) Tj T* (argument authority \(Gate III\) are the author\222s own frameworks, published on LinkedIn in 2026. The Six Gates , version 1.0 \267 September 2026 Written,) Tj T* (illustrated, and typeset by Bhargava P Share it freely, with attribution. The gates protect each other. Bhargava P The Six Gates \267 14 / 14) Tj T* ET
 
